{"step_index":794,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-23T00:02:26Z","content":"Created At: 2026-09-23T09:02:26+09:00\nCompleted At: 2026-09-23T09:02:29+09:00\nThe search for \"\"오픈와이즈\" \"대우에덴프라자\"\" returned the following summary:\n\"(주)오픈와이즈\"는 부산광역시 사하구 낙동대로 542, 대우에덴프라자 3층 301호 208실에 소재한 기업입니다[1].\n\n해당 기업 및 건물에 대한 주요 정보는 다음과 같습니다.\n\n*   **(주)오픈와이즈**: 2022년 4월에 설립된 중소기업으로, 주요 사업 분야는 공공관계 서비스업입니다 [1.1].\n*   **대우에덴프라자**: 부산광역시 사하구 하단동(낙동대로 542)에 위치한 건물로, 아파트 및 근린생활시설이 포함된 공동주택 건물입니다[2][3][4]. 1997년에 준공되었으며, 지상 11층/지하 4층 규모로 이루어져 있습니다[5][4].\n\nSources:\n[1] [dorojuso.kr](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQG73xV9ZCtNfbfhT1FpSxgp2wmlALYR8x0maIJ7f6S_7ieEURfee3W4V1bvG1dxo7u8wiLxRgCwi8Gm_T0CDXVbLK_00tjelGJr_eQSRCQA1D2m1h1HbH8Mau-ljnek5ovesV8E8ilpTbZHSjm3bRzAC9XdA92c5Cai7Vo2Y97zHsC1pbt_K4cSw9OztpH6hw_FbimRUNtu5fZXNxrOHDwgkG2bPY2f74jb5ly7EmubTR4JSzbG3sfZrrjRaruAJNepuWZnPk9X8p0HFq99CYXdzbdzsfci9GfhSw4BxMJZT-3kNpyXCMFd9kf1KwF_C6AJJjrfQEchkeQml4wUuxAlDdYezczUN07e7pcq7-NY7NS2DO4KrlKhbIWIUgPj0P0V8e9EVz5ylFnf3-HaoYNO0Wra)\n[2] [r114.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGEvBqRt2VSVN7vI1VoBjyGGUn-Hcey30ZKGGPh7pQCQpC3lIrPR1aKeEbPbcCq2vVYXQmBLKyhbZ66joGJK328M4GYbhRcJH7wUXl-iRyijQP4-DPXcD4rojXG)\n[3] [zippoom.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHksopZ4UlB_61nqQNQmhod0HU35KFZtoIBxBVX90Dw8MxiiEDStHahI5jy-sifjPLUzVoLN2WROfAXxGCvRB02OAd2Ta2gi40OLbti19Of87WtfNcfGUCauCpc9aQl24pjxQTGwCdmz1AvMCXXRrS7hXNOvXRM1woqoJMmA2zidoUId4vtsD4PbXPLOib-YesoE6-eS0XOQbuxYmetPwzZP_BQF4912L7gCuPj9Gnhw6EQmW1SwUro61DcEd1C5AfEDFLPjW-hDoH-5nRQmnBRi6XBNbL7KgIZWcwnCf56NTNi4-K-Y5Upr5meTiJaAPvNVO5QrmFdew==)\n[4] [zaritalk.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQF12yIDE708eWirTFRknJdFfirNCgtGlHWd25EGlJXGKigyF-KUFwuVb722S